> Trace the executed compact affine architecture

Each conditioner stores 16 hidden weights, 16 hidden biases, 32 head weights
and two head biases: 66 values. Four give 264; log_scale adds two. The total is
**266 values in 17 tensors**. Hidden weights use normal deviation .3 and bias
.05; heads use deviation .01 and zero biases. Native seed 9403 initializes all
forward blocks, then the global scale at zero. The original optional TensorFlow
initial-array directory is absent, so its auto default selects this native
initialization. The executed graph groups two affine stages per block for
readability and counts the actual leaves, with 132 values in each pair.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/rnvp_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
 namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore p(9403);
 n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& x){auto o=n::models::RealNvpDensity(p,x);
  n::model_stage("Affine stages 0 / 1",x,o.coupling1);
  n::model_stage("Affine stages 2 / 3",o.coupling1,o.unscaled);
  return n::model_stage("Positive diagonal scale",o.unscaled,o.latent);
 },"RealNVP: 266 values / 17 leaves");
 n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;options.sizing.minimum_extent=2;options.sizing.max_planes=2;
 auto figure=model.plot(n::zeros({1,2}),options);
 if(figure.parameter_count()!=266||p.size()!=17)throw std::runtime_error("Executed RealNVP census");
 figure.save_svg("build/rnvp_network.svg");
}
```
